BT 1 0 0 1 0 109 Tm /F2 11 Tf 15 TL (This experiment produced a responsive buyer-registration interface for the spice-export website and) Tj T* -0.134315 Tw (demonstrated how Bootstrap and JavaScript work together during form entry. Required fields and the browser) Tj T* 0 Tw (email constraint prevent common input mistakes, while custom password matching demonstrates) Tj T* (application-specific validation. The invalid and valid browser states give the buyer immediate feedback and) Tj T* (keep the page from reloading during the demonstration. The layout was checked as a website screen at) Tj T* (different widths. Because no persistence endpoint is connected in this experiment, the success message) Tj T* (confirms only client-side validation; it does not create an account or send the buyer\222s details to the client. A) Tj T* (later backend step can add secure server validation and storage.) Tj T* ET
