BT 1 0 0 1 0 94 Tm /F2 11 Tf 15 TL (The spice website catalogue provides realistic data for practicing modern JavaScript. Product records are) Tj T* (stored as an array of objects, then processed with arrow functions and array callbacks. A search input and) Tj T* (category buttons raise DOM events; filter\(\) selects matching products, map\(\) formats the visible cards, and) Tj T* (reduce\(\) can summarize catalogue information such as available sample counts. Anonymous functions are) Tj T* (used as event callbacks where an inline action is useful. Browser alert, confirm and prompt examples are) Tj T* (attached to clear sample-request interactions. Each operation is checked in the rendered website so the data) Tj T* (operation and its visible result can be related.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
