BT 1 0 0 1 0 19 Tm /F2 11 Tf 15 TL (Arrow functions provide concise function syntax and are commonly used as callbacks. Anonymous functions) Tj T* (have no declared name and can be passed directly to methods such as forEach\(\) or addEventListener\(\).) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 56.16 294.4898 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 34 Tm /F2 11 Tf 15 TL (Arrays store ordered collections. map\(\) creates a transformed array, filter\(\) selects elements that match a) Tj T* (condition, and reduce\(\) combines array values into one result. These methods are useful for creating) Tj T* (catalogue views and calculating simple summaries.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
