q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 34 Tm 15 TL /F2 11 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Events let a page respond to actions such as clicking a button or submitting a form. The browser) Tj (') Tj (s alert\(\) and) Tj T* (confirm\(\) functions display simple popup dialogs. Popup functions are suitable for demonstrations; a finished) Tj T* (website can replace them with accessible in-page messages.) Tj T* ET
