BT 1 0 0 1 0 94 Tm /F2 11 Tf 15 TL (The React catalogue demonstrates the main ideas of functional components, JSX, props and state in a) Tj T* (spice-export context. JSX defines the card and page markup, while the reusable card receives product details) Tj T* (and a callback from its parent. The parent component owns search and category state, which makes the) Tj T* -0.079026 Tw (visible catalogue respond to user input without a full-page reload. Browser inspection of the cards and filtered) Tj T* 0 Tw (state confirms that data flows from the local array through component props into the interface. The data) Tj T* (source is still local, so this result is not evidence of database retrieval. The component design is ready to be) Tj T* (reused across the routed website and later connected to API responses.) Tj T* ET
