BT 1 0 0 1 0 109 Tm /F2 11 Tf 15 TL (This experiment assembled the spice-export pages into a React single-page application using React Router) Tj T* (and hooks. Route components separate the Home, catalogue, About, registration, sample and contact content,) Tj T* (while the shared layout keeps navigation and page identity consistent. The browser checks showed that the) Tj T* (route content changes as the URL changes and that pages can be opened directly. React state supports the) Tj T* (sample form\222s local confirmation, and useEffect demonstrates how a component can set up and clean up side) Tj T* (effects. These results establish website navigation and client-side interaction. Persistent registrations, sample) Tj T* (requests, verified office details and production routing require later backend configuration and) Tj T* (client-approved business information.) Tj T* ET
